  |                       VERIFICATION LAYER                               |
  |                                                                        |
  |   Input:  path P, threshold eta, compatible set C_k(y)                 |
  |                                                                        |
  |   Compute:  J_hi(P, y; k)  =  sup_{s in C_k(y)} J(P, s)                |
  |             J_lo(P, y; k)  =  inf_{s in C_k(y)} J(P, s)                |
  |                                                                        |
  |   Verdict:  V(P, y; k)  in  { SAT,  UNR,  VIO }                       |
  |                                                                        |
  +------------------------------------------------------------------------+
                                    |
                                    v
                                { SAT, UNR, VIO }

  No cryptography.  No per-query communication.  Deterministic.
